The example partition given for chapter 20 fixes the underlying enumeration: it is exactly the 19th RGF (whether 0-based lex order on strings beginning with 0, or 1-based order on strings beginning with 1). Both of those orderings place chapter 39 at the RGF 01201 / 12312, whose blocks are precisely {{1,4},{2,5},{3}}.  

